this calculation.\"",2,301,138,28709173211650149796,"Local"},
  "MessageTemplate"]], "Message", "MSG",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0008719675721087`*^9, 4.0008723118135014`*^9, 
  4.0008728339368773`*^9, 4.001009935186697*^9, 4.001844533073348*^9}],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{
  "Eigensystem","chnpdef",
   "\"Warning: there is a possibility that the second matrix \
\\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"SparseArray\\\", \\\"[\\\", \
RowBox[{\\\"\[LeftSkeleton]\\\", \\\"1\\\", \\\"\[RightSkeleton]\\\"}], \\\"]\
\\\"}]\\) in the first argument is not positive definite, which is necessary \
for the Arnoldi method to give accurate results.\"",2,301,139,
   28709173211650149796,"Local"},
  "MessageTemplate"]], "Message", "MSG",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0008719675721087`*^9, 4.0008723118135014`*^9, 
